From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 23:43:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 30/35] isolate: attribute generated Wasm dispatch failures by
 phase

Record selector, preparation, and second-selector status and completion separately in the generated-entry acceptance path. Keep the production failure class data-free while allowing focused tests and operator diagnostics to distinguish rejection, trap, and preparation failures without changing runtime authority.
